{"unit_id":"vvxer__dsh-silicon#card-zh","repo":"vvxer/dsh-silicon","commit":"6052261ed9490ed909c98d89712344ae0e80d39a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-silicon（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH 模型会话）：为聊天加入可检索的长期记忆。它注册“硅基保留”模型提供方，并把会话原文保存在本机，按当前消息检索相关旧对话后加入模型请求。功能包括按天追加日志、语义检索历史、维护习惯卡和分层概况，以及定时补做夜间整理；还可选连接本地人格权重服务处理闲聊。适合希望在 DSH 中延续长期对话记忆的用户；需要配置 DeepSeek 上游路由，首次使用会下载本地句向量模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49-63","lib/adapter.js:33-63","lib/memory.js:90-104","lib/nightly.js:78-100"]}
{"unit_id":"vvxer__dsh-silicon#card-en","repo":"vvxer/dsh-silicon","commit":"6052261ed9490ed909c98d89712344ae0e80d39a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-silicon adds searchable long-term memory to DSH chats. It stores daily logs locally, retrieves relevant past messages, and creates habits cards and layered summaries. An optional local service adapts casual replies. Configure a DeepSeek upstream; the embedding model downloads on first use.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49-63","lib/adapter.js:33-63","lib/memory.js:90-104","lib/nightly.js:78-100"]}
